  "releaseNotes": "• New Context.UiControlledApplication property. Helps to manipulate with the Revit ribbon, context menus outside ExternalApplication. \n• Now AsyncEventHandler{T} works in a multithreaded application and returns the result to each recipient.\n• Removed AssemblyLoadContext for addins isolation. It will be moved to Revit itself. [More info.](https://feedback.autodesk.com/project/forum/thread.html?cap=cb0fd5af18bb49b791dfa3f5efc47a72&forid={057e532f-e478-43d9-affc-01b3deb82a76}&topid={8C202188-9EA5-49BE-B95F-7F5115507C88})\n• Removed deprecated features.\n• Fixed dependency resolution, to avoid conflict with the Revit runtime",
